{{also|Opossum}}
==English==
[[File:Opossum_2.jpg|thumb|An '''opossum'''.]]

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|pim|aposoum||white animal}}, from {{der|en|alg-pro|*wa·p-aʔθemwa||white dog}}; compare Ojibwe {{m|oj|waabasim||white dog|sc=Latn}}.

Sometimes falsely attributed to a {{der|en|la|-}} origin, as if from {{m|la|*oppossum}}; confer actual {{noncog|la|possum||I am able, I can}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/əˈpɒsəm/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|ə-päsʹəm}}, {{IPA|/əˈpɑsəm/|lang=en}}<ref name="Dictccom">{{R:Dictionary.com}}</ref><ref name="MWO">{{R:MWO}}</ref><ref>{{R:Collins English Dictionary}}</ref> or in abbreviated form like {{m|en|possum}}, as {{IPAchar|/ˈpɑsəm/|lang=en}}<ref name="Dictccom"/><ref name="MWO"/>
* {{hyphenation|o|pos|sum|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# Any [[American]] [[marsupial]] of the [[family]] [[Didelphidae]]. The common species of the United States is ''[[Didelphis virginiana]]''.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|possum}} {{qualifier|US}}

